  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 503.02 Incomplete Form.\n\n(a) All forms shall be reviewed by the division in accordance with RSA 541-A:29.\n\n(b) The applicant shall be notified of any apparent errors or omissions and allowed to resubmit the form to the division.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
